WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Default Settings are the store-wide values products can inherit. When a product has no special override, it follows these defaults.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Here you set fulfilment availability and how fulfilment is chosen. These labels should match what your store actually offers customers.

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Defaults also cover delivery method and which delivery offers products can use. Incomplete offers or pricing must never silently become free shipping.

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Recommended workflow: set clear defaults, save, then open Delivery Settings Preview for a sample product. Prefer fixing defaults instead of overriding every product.

5
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
In Preview, confirm the product is Currently using Default when no product override exists, and that status is Ready when configuration is complete.
